---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Advertise" description="Advertise with TechOnPlay: sponsored content, display ads and newsletter sponsorship.">
  <section class="container advertise">
    <h1>Advertise with TechOnPlay</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p><strong>Reach the innovators, the builders, and the early adopters.</strong></p>
      <p>
        TechOnPlay connects your brand with a highly engaged audience of
        technology professionals, decision-makers, and enthusiasts in the US
        market. Our readers come to us not just to read, but to discover
        solutions, making this the perfect environment to showcase your
        product.
      </p>

      <h2>Why Partner With Us?</h2>
      <p>
        We don't just chase clicks; we build trust. By advertising with
        TechOnPlay, you position your brand alongside high-quality, unbiased
        content that our readers rely on.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Targeted Audience:</strong> speak directly to users actively searching for SaaS tools, AI solutions, and consumer electronics.</li>
        <li><strong>High Engagement:</strong> our "Utility-First" content strategy ensures your message is seen by users ready to take action.</li>
        <li><strong>Flexible Formats:</strong> from native storytelling to high-impact display ads, we offer solutions that fit your marketing goals.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Advertising Solutions</h2>
      <h3>Sponsored Content</h3>
      <p>Native articles written by our expert team that educate our audience about your product while maintaining editorial integrity. Perfect for complex SaaS tools or new hardware launches.</p>
      <h3>Display Advertising</h3>
      <p>Strategic placements optimized for high visibility. We offer standard IAB formats (Leaderboard, MPU) in high-traffic zones without ruining the user experience.</p>
      <h3>Newsletter Sponsorship</h3>
      <p>Get direct access to our subscribers' inboxes. Your brand, front and center, in our weekly digest of top tech insights.</p>

      <h2>Let's Grow Together</h2>
      <p>
        Ready to amplify your brand's presence in the tech sector? Email us
        to discuss custom packages and rates:
        <a href="mailto:techonplay@gmail.com">techonplay@gmail.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .advertise {
    padding-block: 56px 80px;
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  .advertise h1 {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
</style>
